{"unit_id":"ZhijiangTang__dsh-handoff#card-zh","repo":"ZhijiangTang/dsh-handoff","commit":"e1cfb00c1e9af389fcfb8ce02c093fbfff63f763","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-handoff 是一款面向 DSH 的会话交接工具，可把当前会话的关键信息整理成确定性的 Markdown 文档。它通过注册 handoff 工具读取会话事件流，不调用语言模型，按固定章节汇总用户目标、已完成与未完成事项、下一步建议、关键文件和会话统计。用户可指定输出路径，并选择是否覆盖已有文件；默认写入工作区中的 HANDOFF.md。事件结构不可用时，它会输出带降级说明的模板，遇到越出工作区的路径、已存在文件或写入失败则返回错误结果。适合在结束会话、切换上下文或交接给其他协作者时保存当前进展，不需要 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:332-449","cordis.patch.yml:5-7"]}
{"unit_id":"ZhijiangTang__dsh-handoff#card-en","repo":"ZhijiangTang/dsh-handoff","commit":"e1cfb00c1e9af389fcfb8ce02c093fbfff63f763","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-handoff exports session events as a deterministic Markdown handoff, summarizing goals, completed and pending work, key files, and statistics without an LLM. Set the output path and overwrite option; default is HANDOFF.md. Missing events yield a template. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:332-449","cordis.patch.yml:5-7"]}
